# Browser
# Sylvan Library played by Bot1's page: as the ability resolves the page asks whether to draw two additional cards; then,
# with three cards in hand drawn this turn, it asks for two of them and says what the choice is for - for each, 4 life or
# the top of the library - not that they go back (CR 119.4). Bot1 chooses the Mountain and the Plains, then pays 4 life to
# keep the Mountain and puts the Plains back on top.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Sylvan Library
Swamp x4
Island
Mountain
Plains
Swamp x2

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sylvan Library.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Draw]
Bot1.Accept
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = Sylvan Library: choose 2 cards in your hand drawn this turn - for each, pay 4 life or put it on top of your library
Bot1.Choose(Mountain; Plains)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Decline
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Island; Mountain
Bot1.Library = Plains; Swamp; Swamp
Bot1.Life = 16
